- a raw error message on a wrong password;
- "Not found in sources" shown on fields that haven't been researched yet;
- a misaligned Research button on desktop;
- tap targets that are too small at 375 px;
- a raw field key in the contested list;
- navigation links shown to signed-out visitors;
- `RUN.md` still tagging the image as stage 1.

